>am not looking for some neat daemon, but just a simple fixit we can have

Get into mail and type:

        SET FORWARD "IN%""username@whatever.blah.etc"""

This assumes the VAX is on the Internet and that the Internet mailer
is IN%.  It could be MX% or WINS% or something else entirely.  Depends
on the setup.

>a friend do over the phone..  Also, is it possible to do a TALK on a
>Internet UNIX machine to a Bitnet VAX/VMS machine?

No, but many VAX computers are on the Internet.  They may have TALK
installed and then it would be possible.  Another alternative is IRC.
(This also requires Internet access...)
