It's been a month since the question/answer was posted, but I've found a 
way to get rid of the ONE blank page by looking at the way DEC sets up
Pathworks queues.

Here's the contents of my LJ$RESET entry:
 	<ESC>]VMS;2<ESC>\          
 	<ESC>P
 	<ESC>&1T
 	<ESC>E
 	<ESC>\

The first line sends an undocumented command to the symbiont to disable
the EOJ FF (sneaky, huh).  The <ESC>P and <ESC>\ surround device control
information so the symbiont can ignore it.  <ESC>&1T specifies EOJ and
will jog your paper if you have a jogger. <ESC>E is a general reset.

I have a number of form definitions/control files set up to do 
PORTRAIT, LANDSCAPE, and DUPLEX in case anyone wants them.

 						cul... de Robert


